{"id":"cf2cc39a9b1c7b63","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent.md","title":"极大独立集与最大独立集","display":"df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent — 极大独立集与最大独立集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent","aliases":["73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent"],"display":"df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent — 极大独立集与最大独立集","depends_on":["[[73-df-independent-set-language]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.2, print pp. 459–462; PDF pp. 481–484; terminology disambiguation","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent — 极大独立集与最大独立集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ffeeb732a24b7769\" href=\"?note=ffeeb732a24b7769\" title=\"73-df-independent-set-language\">73-df-independent-set-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2, print pp. 459–462; PDF pp. 481–484; terminology disambiguation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_n\">\\(S\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>；独立性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ffeeb732a24b7769\" href=\"?note=ffeeb732a24b7769\" title=\"73-df-independent-set-language\">73-df-independent-set-language</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaximalInd}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land\\neg\\exists T\\subseteq V_n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(T)\\land S\\subsetneq T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaximalInd}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land\\neg\\exists T\\subseteq V_n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(T)\\land S\\subsetneq T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land\\forall T\\subseteq V_n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(T)\\Longrightarrow |T|\\le |S|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land\\forall T\\subseteq V_n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(T)\\Longrightarrow |T|\\le |S|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(n,E)\\coloneqq\\max\\{|S|:S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha(n,E)\\coloneqq\\max\\{|S|:S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>教材 p.459 用 maximal 表示“顶点数最多”，这里明确分成按包含关系极大和按基数最大。α 的集合非空（含空集）且有限，故最大值存在。不能把可贪心构造的极大集误当作 NP 难的最大集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-independent-set-language","status":"resolved","id":"ffeeb732a24b7769","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-independent-set-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-independent-set-language","status":"resolved","id":"ffeeb732a24b7769","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)$，$S\\subseteq V_n$；独立性采用 [[73-df-independent-set-language]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MaximalInd}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land\\neg\\exists T\\subseteq V_n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(T)\\land S\\subsetneq T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\land\\forall T\\subseteq V_n\\;\n(\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(T)\\Longrightarrow |T|\\le |S|).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha(n,E)\\coloneqq\\max\\{|S|:S\\subseteq V_n\\land\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1661,"backlinks":[{"id":"00b831f06a1e9a49","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent|极大独立集与最大独立集]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"6d2cda23f5f4d367","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ffeeb732a24b7769"]}